# tally 2.1.8 R14 (#172), L §5.10: a message names the unit of the read that met it: PLN's reading breaks min 0,
# and RUN-PLACE names PLN's balance though EUR sorts first; EUR's read is not refused.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit USD: currency minor 0.01
kind wallets: place any min 0
place broker: wallets lives 2025-01-01..

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  anchor broker
  opening[broker] = 1.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[broker] = 2.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[broker] = 4.00 EUR at 2026-02-15 end "s"
  stated[broker] = -3.00 PLN at 2026-02-15 end "s"

ask a: bal(broker, EUR, 2026-02-20)
ask b: bal(broker, PLN, 2026-02-20)
=== expect
a: 4.00 EUR
  anchor: broker 2026-02-15 end, stated 4.00 EUR, difference 3.00 EUR
  cut 2026-06-10
b: refused: RUN-PLACE broker is -3.00 PLN after its reading at 2026-02-15 end
  anchor: broker 2026-02-15 end, stated -3.00 PLN, difference -5.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-10
